EBS is used for much more than creating disks.

Think of the industry flow like this:

AWS EBS
   ↓
Attach / Detach
   ↓
Linux detects disk
   ↓
Partition / Filesystem / LVM
   ↓
Mount
   ↓
Application uses storage
   ↓
Monitor
   ↓
Backup / Snapshot
   ↓
Resize when required
   ↓
Troubleshoot when something goes wrong

